1
00:00:00,041 --> 00:00:01,251
[PEARL]
Hey!

2
00:00:01,584 --> 00:00:02,584
When did you get back?

3
00:00:02,585 --> 00:00:04,420
I can't miss this
for the world.

4
00:00:04,421 --> 00:00:06,630
I got accepted in the
scholarship, Sir Han.

5
00:00:06,631 --> 00:00:07,465
I know.

6
00:00:07,549 --> 00:00:08,341
Pearl…

7
00:00:08,383 --> 00:00:09,383
[KOREAN]
I love you.

8
00:00:09,384 --> 00:00:12,470
Sir Han...
I love you, too.

9
00:00:16,182 --> 00:00:18,852
- [ARIEL] Han Bin oppa!
- [KARA] Nice to see you!

10
00:00:18,893 --> 00:00:19,978
Hug, hug, hug, hug!

11
00:00:20,019 --> 00:00:22,063
[CAROL CRIES]

12
00:00:22,188 --> 00:00:22,897
[JAO]
Kara?

13
00:00:22,898 --> 00:00:23,898
Surprise visit?

14
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,651
You're so dramatic.
Of course I came to see you, too.

15
00:00:27,444 --> 00:00:28,737
[KARA CHUCKLES]

16
00:00:29,154 --> 00:00:30,655
Thank you so much
for the offer.

17
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:32,907
I'll let you know my
decision by Friday.

18
00:00:33,032 --> 00:00:34,325
[PURE COAST OFFICER]
Thank you, Caitlyn.

19
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:36,953
We're looking forward to working with
you here in Denmark and wherever...

20
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:38,580
[CAROL]
You know that...

21
00:00:38,621 --> 00:00:40,622
I support you, right?

22
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:42,625
Wherever you may go.

23
00:00:42,959 --> 00:00:43,959
Are you happy?

24
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,669
Jao, I'm leaving Siargao.

25
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,088
Kara, you're leaving the island?

26
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:49,299
I always say I'll
go with the flow.

27
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:50,549
But this time...

28
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,552
I'll decide where
the flow takes me.

29
00:00:52,594 --> 00:00:53,802
Will this make you happy?

30
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:56,097
[JAO] If you ever
decide to come back,

31
00:00:56,139 --> 00:00:58,725
just find me
where you left me.

32
00:01:00,727 --> 00:01:08,151
[FIRE CRACKLING]

33
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:15,825
[FIRE CRACKLING]

34
00:01:15,867 --> 00:01:17,744
Jao, I'm sorry.

35
00:01:24,375 --> 00:01:25,877
I love you, Kara.

36
00:01:28,171 --> 00:01:29,756
I love you, too, Jao.

37
00:01:40,725 --> 00:01:41,935
What now?

38
00:01:48,733 --> 00:01:49,943
[JAO]
Just like before…

39
00:01:53,863 --> 00:01:55,448
We’ll just go with the flow.

40
00:01:57,784 --> 00:01:59,494
And let the wave take us.

41
00:02:17,929 --> 00:02:22,433
[ALON BY JL]

42
00:03:54,776 --> 00:03:55,818
[KARA SNIFFS]

43
00:03:56,194 --> 00:04:01,157
[KARA CRIES SOFTLY]

44
00:04:06,829 --> 00:04:07,830
[WOMAN]
Here.

45
00:04:10,708 --> 00:04:13,419
Thank you.
Sorry.

46
00:04:14,045 --> 00:04:15,546
Just cry it out.

47
00:04:21,719 --> 00:04:23,596
Tears of joy or pain?

48
00:04:23,638 --> 00:04:24,846
[KARA CHUCKLES]

49
00:04:24,847 --> 00:04:26,724
[KARA BREATHES DEEPLY]

50
00:04:26,766 --> 00:04:27,725
Both.

51
00:04:29,602 --> 00:04:30,895
Boat.
[KARA CHUCKLES]

52
00:04:30,937 --> 00:04:31,938
[WOMAN]
What?

53
00:04:33,106 --> 00:04:34,399
Nothing.

54
00:04:35,942 --> 00:04:38,360
It’s okay.
I know the feeling.

55
00:04:38,361 --> 00:04:40,071
Did you get hit by
the Siargao Curse?

56
00:04:42,615 --> 00:04:44,325
It wasn't a curse.

57
00:04:45,743 --> 00:04:47,161
It was a blessing.

58
00:04:49,372 --> 00:04:50,873
[KARA LAUGHS]

59
00:04:52,667 --> 00:04:53,668
Thank you for this.

60
00:04:53,710 --> 00:04:55,294
- [WOMAN] Want more?
- Yes, please.

61
00:04:55,670 --> 00:05:01,175
[PA SYSTEM] Final boarding call for
flight 2R 990 bound for Clark, Pampanga.

62
00:05:02,343 --> 00:05:03,720
[WOMAN] You can have it.
- [KARA] Thank you.

63
00:05:03,761 --> 00:05:08,850
[PA SYSTEM] Final boarding call for
flight 2R 990 bound for Clark, Pampanga.

64
00:05:08,891 --> 00:05:11,644
[KARA CRIES]

65
00:05:14,939 --> 00:05:17,942
[KARA BREATHES DEEPLY]

66
00:05:29,078 --> 00:05:30,496
[WOMAN]
See you!

67
00:05:31,622 --> 00:05:32,832
[KARA EXHALES]

68
00:05:33,332 --> 00:05:41,132
[KARA BREATHES DEEPLY]

69
00:05:41,883 --> 00:05:46,219
[USAD BY CUATRO]

70
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:48,555
[KOREAN]
Wow, you’re totally crazy!

71
00:05:48,556 --> 00:05:50,058
The curse is real!

72
00:05:50,099 --> 00:05:51,933
Yes!
[LAUGHING]

73
00:05:51,934 --> 00:05:54,854
[KARA] Long time no see!
When did you get back?

74
00:05:55,813 --> 00:05:57,315
- Hi, Kara!
- [KARA] It's aligned, right?

75
00:05:57,356 --> 00:05:58,649
Ariel, give Kara a hand.

76
00:05:58,691 --> 00:06:00,068
You’re smiling like this!

77
00:06:00,485 --> 00:06:02,487
- So this is smiling?
- Yes!

78
00:06:02,528 --> 00:06:04,529
- Does he smell good?
- [KARA LAUGHS]

79
00:06:04,530 --> 00:06:05,490
Like baby powder?

80
00:06:05,531 --> 00:06:07,158
Doesn’t he always look like
he smells like baby powder?

81
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:07,992
- Right?
- [KARA LAUGHS]

82
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:10,036
- Thanks, Carol.
- I love you.

83
00:06:10,078 --> 00:06:11,078
[KARA]
Super thank you.

84
00:06:11,079 --> 00:06:13,413
You deserve it, okay?
Okay.

85
00:06:13,414 --> 00:06:14,624
Enough drama.

86
00:06:14,665 --> 00:06:16,876
[CROWD CHEERING]

87
00:06:16,918 --> 00:06:18,503
[JAO]
Wait! Wait!

88
00:06:19,045 --> 00:06:24,257
You're going to need some fuel
because things are getting intense here.

89
00:06:24,258 --> 00:06:25,383
Hug, hug, hug, hug!

90
00:06:25,384 --> 00:06:28,304
[CAROL CRIES]

91
00:06:31,349 --> 00:06:32,433
Kara, Jao.

92
00:06:32,975 --> 00:06:33,810
Kara, Jao...

93
00:06:33,810 --> 00:06:34,727
[SIARGAONON]
Karajaw!

94
00:06:34,728 --> 00:06:36,729
Like the Siargaonon
term for “super”!

95
00:06:36,771 --> 00:06:37,980
Wow! Wonderful!
Right?

96
00:06:38,064 --> 00:06:39,065
Look.

97
00:06:39,857 --> 00:06:41,651
There’s pancit in the sky!

98
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:51,828
It wasn’t Siargao.

99
00:06:53,037 --> 00:06:54,330
And you weren’t there.

100
00:07:01,462 --> 00:07:02,880
You’re not extending your stay?

101
00:07:03,923 --> 00:07:05,423
- No, don’t tempt me!
- [KARA LAUGHS]

102
00:07:05,424 --> 00:07:07,259
Ruth, this is Jao.

103
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,970
Jao, Ruth.

104
00:07:12,557 --> 00:07:16,560
We hope you'll support
Pure Coast's goal...

105
00:07:16,561 --> 00:07:18,771
Team Mangroves forever!

106
00:07:18,813 --> 00:07:19,813
[CROWD CHEERING]

107
00:07:19,814 --> 00:07:21,816
- [JAO] Use both hands. There you go.
- [KARA] There.

108
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:23,860
- [ARIEL] There you go.
- [JAO] Push it down first.

109
00:07:34,537 --> 00:07:37,456
[KARA CRIES]

110
00:07:37,623 --> 00:07:46,174
[KARA CRIES]

111
00:07:46,382 --> 00:07:52,722
[KARA BREATHES HEAVILY]

112
00:07:52,847 --> 00:07:53,848
[KARA SNIFFS]

113
00:07:56,100 --> 00:08:05,109
[KARA BREATHES DEEPLY]

114
00:08:15,661 --> 00:08:16,662
[FLIGHT ATTENDANT]
Okay.

115
00:08:43,564 --> 00:08:47,026
[JAO VOICEOVER] A lot of people
wonder if the Siargao Curse is real,

116
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:50,655
or if people simply stay
because they love it here.

117
00:08:51,489 --> 00:08:53,783
It's not hard to fall
in love with Siargao.

118
00:08:54,909 --> 00:08:56,911
We have everything here.

119
00:08:58,371 --> 00:09:00,039
Pristine nature.

120
00:09:04,168 --> 00:09:06,379
Friendship and community.

121
00:09:09,215 --> 00:09:13,386
[LAUGHING]

122
00:09:13,678 --> 00:09:14,679
[JAO VOICEOVER]
Family.

123
00:09:14,887 --> 00:09:16,555
Okay, come on.
More, more photos.

124
00:09:16,597 --> 00:09:18,306
- Come on, Jao, it’s time to eat!
- Am I okay here?

125
00:09:18,307 --> 00:09:20,725
- We’ve taken a lot already.
- [JAO] Yes, Carol. Just sit right there.

126
00:09:20,726 --> 00:09:24,354
You, Mr. Han…
switch sides.

127
00:09:24,355 --> 00:09:25,147
[HAN BIN]
Oh, okay.

128
00:09:25,189 --> 00:09:27,190
So many pictures.
We've been at this forever!

129
00:09:27,191 --> 00:09:28,693
- [JAO] Okay, ready.
- Okay, let's go!

130
00:09:28,734 --> 00:09:29,819
- Let’s eat!
- Let's move closer.

131
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:31,153
- Closer, closer, closer!
- [ARIEL] This better be the last one!

132
00:09:31,195 --> 00:09:33,072
- [HAN BIN] Closer? Closer?
- Closer. Ready. One…

133
00:09:33,114 --> 00:09:34,114
We’re closer!

134
00:09:34,115 --> 00:09:35,741
[JAO]
One… two…

135
00:09:36,909 --> 00:09:37,702
Okay.

136
00:09:37,743 --> 00:09:39,829
- [HAN BIN] Okay!
- [ARIEL] That’s the last one, okay?

137
00:09:39,870 --> 00:09:41,664
[ARIEL] Mom, let's eat.
Where's the grilled fish?

138
00:09:41,706 --> 00:09:45,293
But, wait, look at this.
Something’s weird with your photo, guys.

139
00:09:45,334 --> 00:09:47,295
[CAROL] Didn’t we bring
the grilled fish earlier?

140
00:09:47,628 --> 00:09:48,629
- [ARIEL] It’s Princess...
- [CAROL] Isn't that...

141
00:09:48,671 --> 00:09:50,380
- [ARIEL] Mom! It’s Princess Pearl!
- [CAROL SCREAMS EXCITEDLY]

142
00:09:50,381 --> 00:09:52,383
- [HAN BIN SCREAMS EXCITEDLY]
- [ARIEL] Pearl’s here!

143
00:09:52,425 --> 00:09:54,969
[ARIEL] Hey! Hey, Pearl,
why did you hug him first?

144
00:09:55,011 --> 00:09:56,971
- [ARIEL] He got to hug you before we did!
- I really missed you!

145
00:09:57,013 --> 00:09:58,430
[ARIEL]
We’re your family, remember?

146
00:09:58,431 --> 00:09:59,640
- [PEARL] Ariel!
[CAROL] You didn't tell us!

147
00:09:59,682 --> 00:10:00,682
[CAROL]
Who picked you up?

148
00:10:00,683 --> 00:10:01,891
[ARIEL]
When did you get here?

149
00:10:01,892 --> 00:10:03,894
- [CAROL] Who picked you up at the airport?
- [PEARL] Tantan did!

150
00:10:03,936 --> 00:10:05,730
[ARIEL]
It was you? Tantan!

151
00:10:05,771 --> 00:10:07,773
- [ARIEL] You didn't even tell us!
- [PEARL] Jao!

152
00:10:08,190 --> 00:10:09,191
Welcome back.

153
00:10:10,651 --> 00:10:12,485
[ARIEL]
Hey, you're so special!

154
00:10:12,486 --> 00:10:14,487
The first one to be hugged.

155
00:10:14,488 --> 00:10:15,448
[ARIEL]
Hey.

156
00:10:15,489 --> 00:10:17,283
- [PEARL] I missed you, too.
- [ARIEL] Hey, what about the laptop I asked you to buy?

157
00:10:17,325 --> 00:10:19,326
- [HAN BIN] I miss you so much.
- [ARIEL] Hey, I asked you to buy it for me.

158
00:10:19,327 --> 00:10:21,829
[CAROL]
It's so pretty!

159
00:10:24,290 --> 00:10:26,709
[JAO VOICEOVER]
There’s so much in this island.

160
00:10:30,338 --> 00:10:34,008
But some say love
is the ultimate curse.

161
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:38,763
But every curse has a cure.

162
00:10:40,222 --> 00:10:43,017
A cure that only time can bring.

163
00:10:51,609 --> 00:10:59,575
[WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY]

164
00:11:02,703 --> 00:11:05,498
[JAO VOICEOVER] Two years ago,
I learned my greatest lesson in life

165
00:11:05,539 --> 00:11:07,541
when I came home to Siargao.

166
00:11:08,459 --> 00:11:12,129
I learned that love is the
opposite of possession.

167
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:13,964
Love...

168
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:15,591
is freedom.

169
00:11:25,768 --> 00:11:28,270
It's wishing the
person you love well,

170
00:11:28,479 --> 00:11:31,482
even though they chose a
journey different from yours.

171
00:11:32,775 --> 00:11:34,193
[NOAH]
Caitlyn!

172
00:11:40,449 --> 00:11:41,450
Is that it?

173
00:11:41,617 --> 00:11:42,618
[NOAH]
Yes.

174
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:49,667
“A writ of preliminary injunction
is hereby issued, ordering

175
00:11:49,708 --> 00:11:53,212
Northern Summit Mining Corporation
to immediately cease and desist

176
00:11:53,504 --> 00:11:56,590
from all mining and related
activities within the subject areas.

177
00:11:57,299 --> 00:11:58,676
Effective immediately.”

178
00:11:59,260 --> 00:12:00,344
We did it!

179
00:12:00,386 --> 00:12:02,595
[NOAH] Perfect timing,
right when you got back to Manila.

180
00:12:02,596 --> 00:12:05,516
Looks like they were just waiting for
you before handing over the resolution.

181
00:12:06,392 --> 00:12:08,769
[KARA] We should
let the elders know.

182
00:12:09,103 --> 00:12:11,312
The two community leaders
are on their way here.

183
00:12:11,313 --> 00:12:12,815
They want to
personally thank you.

184
00:12:12,857 --> 00:12:16,068
Since you’re the one who got this
started before you left for Denmark.

185
00:12:17,111 --> 00:12:20,823
I'm just happy they'll finally be
able to protect their ancestral land.

186
00:12:20,990 --> 00:12:22,992
- The world is healing!
- [KARA LAUGHS]

187
00:12:23,909 --> 00:12:25,911
Sir Noah,
I'm heading to the airport.

188
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,413
Where are you going?

189
00:12:27,455 --> 00:12:29,832
They're being dispatched
today to their new assignment.

190
00:12:29,874 --> 00:12:30,958
To Siargao.

191
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,376
Have you been?

192
00:12:36,005 --> 00:12:37,840
If love was a place,

193
00:12:37,882 --> 00:12:39,592
it would be Siargao.

194
00:13:04,450 --> 00:13:08,829
[BRUSHING TEETH]

195
00:13:10,247 --> 00:13:13,918
[SWISHING WATER]

196
00:13:14,126 --> 00:13:15,336
[HAN BIN CLEARS THROAT]

197
00:13:16,879 --> 00:13:19,381
Pearl, you're so pretty.

198
00:13:25,721 --> 00:13:28,807
Pearl, you're so beautiful.

199
00:13:30,684 --> 00:13:32,186
Sir Han!

200
00:14:16,647 --> 00:14:17,648
Mom.

201
00:14:18,524 --> 00:14:19,483
Dad.

202
00:14:20,859 --> 00:14:22,236
Uh...

203
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:26,407
The house I'm building
here is almost finished.

204
00:14:27,575 --> 00:14:30,411
I'm excited to come
home here every Sunday.

205
00:14:30,911 --> 00:14:34,582
I've just been so busy in GL.
There's so much going on.

206
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:38,252
Mom, if only you could see...

207
00:14:38,836 --> 00:14:40,838
the developments
happening there now.

208
00:14:41,589 --> 00:14:46,260
It's so different now from
the General Luna I grew up in.

209
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:54,143
Mom, Dad...

210
00:14:56,145 --> 00:14:57,354
Thank you.

211
00:15:01,108 --> 00:15:03,193
Thank you for everything...

212
00:15:04,028 --> 00:15:05,863
you've taught me.

213
00:15:07,948 --> 00:15:09,950
Thank you for inspiring me.

214
00:15:13,829 --> 00:15:15,122
Because of that,

215
00:15:17,124 --> 00:15:18,542
I finally found

216
00:15:20,628 --> 00:15:21,837
where I belong.

217
00:15:26,216 --> 00:15:27,217
Thank you.

218
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,721
[JAO SNIFFS]

219
00:15:31,347 --> 00:15:33,265
Mom, Dad,
I hope...

220
00:15:34,266 --> 00:15:36,268
you're proud of me.
And...

221
00:15:37,102 --> 00:15:38,812
I hope you're
proud of your son.

222
00:15:39,355 --> 00:15:40,731
[EGAY]
Uncle Jao!

223
00:15:42,441 --> 00:15:43,734
Oh! Egay!

224
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:49,490
[JAO] You've been
the one bringing these?

225
00:15:51,033 --> 00:15:52,534
You're such a good kid.

226
00:15:52,576 --> 00:15:54,078
Let me see those grades.

227
00:15:58,290 --> 00:16:00,000
Wow. 98?

228
00:16:00,334 --> 00:16:01,752
That’s your average?

229
00:16:01,794 --> 00:16:02,878
That's really high!

230
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:04,713
I'm in the top 10.

231
00:16:05,047 --> 00:16:06,965
Very good!
Up here.

232
00:16:07,132 --> 00:16:08,549
Let's go.
What do you want?

233
00:16:08,550 --> 00:16:10,052
We have to celebrate.

234
00:16:10,719 --> 00:16:12,429
Since you got
good grades.

235
00:16:12,513 --> 00:16:14,390
Let's eat at GL Pizza.

236
00:16:14,848 --> 00:16:17,851
GL Pizza? What else?
How about we get a burger with that?

237
00:16:18,018 --> 00:16:19,352
Come on,
what else do you want?

238
00:16:19,353 --> 00:16:20,770
- [JAO] Besides pizza.
- Chicharon.

239
00:16:20,771 --> 00:16:22,481
Chicharon?
(Deep-fried pork rinds)

240
00:16:22,523 --> 00:16:23,899
What a weird combo.

241
00:16:23,941 --> 00:16:25,943
Bye, Mom! Bye, Dad!
Love you!

242
00:16:42,084 --> 00:16:43,794
[JAO VOICEOVER]
Love is a curse.

243
00:16:44,753 --> 00:16:48,048
And they say,
Siargao has a curse.

244
00:16:50,843 --> 00:16:53,637
[SIARGAONON]
Siargao is beautiful!

245
00:16:55,347 --> 00:16:56,724
[JAO VOICEOVER]
But if you're lucky,

246
00:16:56,765 --> 00:16:59,101
and you find the
right person for you

247
00:16:59,727 --> 00:17:01,228
here on the island,

248
00:17:02,020 --> 00:17:03,814
and the timing is right...

249
00:17:04,231 --> 00:17:05,941
